{"id":"n61183-4-14","stage":2,"title":"나서다 · 走出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61183-4-14-1","ko":"갈 길이 머니 이제 그만 자리에서 일어나겠습니다.","zh":"回去路还远，我就先告辞了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"갈","meaning":"通往，通向","explanation":"가다：通往，通向；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"16","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈","audio":"/audio/eb4ba4907fe859283419.mp3"}},{"text":"길이","meaning":"路，路途","explanation":"길：路，路途；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"3","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"머니","meaning":"远，所以……（路程）","explanation":"멀다：路程远；-니：原因，因为。멀다 接 -니 时 ㄹ 脱落，成为 머니；这里既不是多少钱，也不是疑问句。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"1","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머니","audio":"/audio/e0c6659edf8703748c75.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"그만","meaning":"就那些，到此为止","explanation":"그만：就那些，到此为止。","readings":[{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36428","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3"}},{"text":"자리에서","meaning":"位置，位子，地方","explanation":"자리：位置，位子，地方；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"1","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자리에서","audio":"/audio/a07ffc28ae9e925cfe24.mp3"}},{"text":"일어나겠습니다.","meaning":"起，起来","explanation":"일어나다：起，起来；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"1","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어나겠습니다","audio":"/audio/0fcfcf1df3aeaf9bf2ac.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"通往，通向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"朝着或连着某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，路途","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"为了到达一定目的地而经过的空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"远（距离）","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"远（距离）","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"38c09c96aa077d27","term":"그만","zh":"就那些，到此为止","audio":"/audio/38c09c96aa077d2721fe.mp3","entryId":"36428","definition":"就到那个程度。","pronunciation":["그만"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"位置，位子，地方","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"人或东西所占据的空间。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"起，起来","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"由躺而坐或由坐而站。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a91134c8a7b4d78d3ce9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61183-4-14-2","ko":"그래요. 얼른 길을 나서셔야지요.","zh":"好，您得赶紧出发了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地。","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"길을","meaning":"路，路途","explanation":"길：路，路途；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"3","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길을","audio":"/audio/a41fdccc5780433c53cc.mp3"}},{"text":"나서셔야지요.","meaning":"走出，出发","explanation":"나서다：走出，出发；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；어야지요：礼貌地表示应当、必要或决心；也可随语境构成反问。","readings":[{"term":"나서다","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61183","senseId":"4","lemma":"나서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나서셔야지요","audio":"/audio/f0846270c7ced77c2d5e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，路途","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"为了到达一定目的地而经过的空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"d8c0446b0a9a131b","term":"나서다","zh":"走出，出发","audio":"/audio/d8c0446b0a9a131b1db7.mp3","entryId":"61183","definition":"为去某处而从身在地方出来或离开。","pronunciation":["나서다"]}],"audio":"/audio/20242e0164116a4e03fd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.4,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61183","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"중급","day":72,"sequenceScore":1.9521,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好，您得赶紧出发了。","我觉得好像有人在一直跟在我们后面。","回去路还远，我就先告辞了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好，您得赶紧出发了。","回去路还远，我就先告辞了。","我觉得好像有人在一直跟在我们后面。"],"answer":0}]}
